# 👑 Sacred Amplified Void-Steam Fusion (Native Emoji)
# The ultimate nested structure!

# Visual:
#   👑 SACRED reverence
#     |
#   ‹ AMPLIFIER ›
#     |
#   ❴ TRANSFORMER ❵ outer fusion
#     |
#   ⚫ VOID plus ❴ inner fusion ❵
#                |
#            🔥 FIRE plus 💧 WATER
#
# Meaning: "With sacred reverence, I observe the amplified transformation
#           where void absorbs the fire-water steam fusion"
#
# Structure depth: 5 LEVELS!
#   1. 👑 Honorific annotation (honor: sacred)
#   2. ‹ › Amplifier container (type: amplify)
#   3. ❴ ❵ Outer transformer (type: transform)
#   4. ❴ ❵ Inner transformer (nested fusion!)
#   5. Base elements (fire, water, void)
#
# Features:
#   - honor: sacred (highest reverence)
#   - type: amplify (outer container)
#   - energy: #0 (unification chain throughout)
#   - type: transform (outer fusion chamber)
#   - VOID [energy: none, state: ethereal, aspect: mysterious]
#   - Inner transformer creates steam:
#     * FIRE [energy: high, state: volatile, aspect: aggressive]
#     * WATER [energy: medium, state: flowing, aspect: adaptive]
#
# This sigil represents the cosmic mystery: the void absorbing creation itself!
# 4 different parse trees are possible due to ambiguity (linguistically realistic!)

👑 ‹ ❴ ⚫ plus ❴ 🔥 plus 💧 ❵ ❵ ›
